Course: ICT251 – Backend Development

Project Description

CampusCare is a campus maintenance request system that allows users to submit and manage maintenance issues.

Technologies Used

- Node.js
- Express.js
- PostgreSQL
- REST API

Main Features

- Create maintenance requests
- View all requests
- View a request by ID
- Update requests
- Delete requests

API Routes

- GET "/"
- GET "/health"
- GET "/api/records"
- GET "/api/records/:id"
- POST "/api/records"
- PUT "/api/records/:id"
- DELETE "/api/records/:id"
